WEBVTT

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:06.112
Reviewing submissions

00:00:06.162 --> 00:00:10.026
Open Assignments and click the number in the Submissions column.

00:00:21.871 --> 00:00:26.785
Press Grade, enter the marks and some feedback, and press Save.

00:00:38.556 --> 00:00:42.699
A graded submission can be sent back to the student with Return.

00:00:45.393 --> 00:00:50.077
Submission graded
